# Build context of infra/docker/*.Dockerfile (the repository root). The
# Dockerfiles copy explicit paths only; this list also keeps secrets, installed
# dependencies, build output and caches out of the context sent to the daemon.

# Secrets and local configuration
**/.env
**/.env.*
**/*.pem
**/*.key

# Version control and CI
.git
.github

# Installed dependencies and build output (rebuilt inside the images)
**/node_modules
**/.venv
**/dist
**/*.tsbuildinfo
**/.vite

# Python caches
**/__pycache__
**/*.py[cod]
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache
**/.pytest_cache

# Coverage, logs and load-test output
**/.coverage
**/.coverage.*
**/coverage
**/htmlcov
**/*.log
loadtest

# Documentation
docs
